=2 Walkthrough
* Begin the quest by speaking with Chumimi, found in the basement of {z:Heavens Tower} (Windurst).
** You must be on Black Mage to start this quest.
** During this cutscene you will be asked to agree with one of the three NPCs. Whomever you pick will decide your title, but otherwise will not affect your quest.
** After this cutscene, you may continue on any job.
* After speaking with Chumimi, head to any {p:Telepoint} and trade a synthesis crystal to receive a {@i:Faded Crystal|613} {i:Faded Crystal|Faded Crystal|613}.
* Travel to {z:Xarcabard} and head toward (E-8)
* Find a ??? marker in the glowing trenches.
** This is very close to the {z:Castle Zvahl Baileys} zone. Easiest way to get here is via the {z:Castle Zvahl Baileys} {p:Survival Guide} and just zoning out to Xarcabard.
* Trade your {@i:Faded Crystal|613} {i:Faded Crystal|Faded Crystal|613} and spawn the Chaos Elemental.
** The Chaos Elemental is a {m:Light Elemental}, therefore it is resistant to all physical damage. A party of 6 at level 40 should be able to kill it.
** If multiple people are doing the quest you will need to wait 3 min after it dies to pop again.
* Take the {@i:Glowstone|1104} {i:Glowstone|Glowstone|1104} that drops from the NM and return to {n:Chumimi}.
** She will give you the {@i:Casting Wand|17423} {i:Casting Wand|Casting Wand|17423} in return.

